The files in this directory are adapted from AI Elements
(https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements, registry https://elements.ai-sdk.dev, 2026-08-21).
They were modified for Helena: its type scale and colours, its i18n, plain-http support,
and trimmed to the parts Helena uses. The original licence follows.

